## ⏱ Time and Space Complexity

| Operation          | Complexity |
|--------------------|------------|
| append             | `O(1)` — normalization with modular inverse |
| addAll             | `O(1)` |
| multAll            | `O(1)` |
| getIndex           | `O(1)` |
| Space Complexity   | `O(n)` — storing normalized values |

